{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31494","headline":"饭僧 · 李羣玉","name":"饭僧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"好读天竺书，爲寻无生理。\n焚香面金偈，一室唯巾水。\n交信方外言，二三空门子。\n峻范照秋霜，高标揜僧史。\n清晨洁蔬茗，延请良有以。\n一落喧譁竞，栖心愿依止。\n奔曦入半百，冉冉颓蒙汜。\n云泛名利心，风轻是非齿。\n向爲情爱缚，未尽金仙旨。\n以静制猨心，将虞瞥然起。\n纶巾与藜杖，此意真已矣。\n他日云壑间，来寻幽居士。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31494.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31494","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}